Sometimes the armor, tripe rations, shops, and so on, aren't there.
I've been off the turnip truck for a while. *shrug*

If you're going to Minetown as XL1, especially as a human, it's
probably best to go straight there and not dawdle looking for armor.
You can pick up armor on the way back, right?

If you're XL2+ you are inviting the creation of more difficult
wandering monsters. Dodging darts is more fun than hiding from ponies.
As a healer you get quite a few HP/level but as an archaeologist HP
gain is so slow that you may as well go in with your starting HP
because a couple more levels isn't going to do that much good.

But obviously YMMV.

